      "retweet": {
        "id": "2106874267019440441",
        "text": "Grok 4.7 is now available on Amazon Bedrock and on Google's Gemini Enterprise Agent Platform.\n\nBoth platforms already offered Grok 4.6. Grok 4.7 is SpaceXAI's model for coding and knowledge work, and its docs call it the most capable model SpaceXAI has built.\n\nOn the xAI API, Grok 4.7 has a 500k context window and costs $2 input and $6 output per million tokens below 200k prompt tokens.",
